Usage: cardano-cli dijkstra stake-pool bls-registration-certificate online 
                                                                             [--cardano-mode
                                                                               [--epoch-slots SLOTS]]
                                                                             ( --mainnet
                                                                             | --testnet-magic NATURAL
                                                                             )
                                                                             --socket-path SOCKET_PATH
                                                                             [ --volatile-tip
                                                                             | --immutable-tip
                                                                             ]
                                                                             --stake-pool-id STAKE_POOL_ID
                                                                             ( --current-params
                                                                             | --pending-params
                                                                             )
                                                                             --bls-signing-key-file FILEPATH
                                                                             --out-file FILEPATH
                                                                             

  Create the certificate from the pool parameters that a running node reports.
  Needs a connection to the node.

Available options:
  --cardano-mode           For talking to a node running in full Cardano mode
                           (default).
  --epoch-slots SLOTS      The number of slots per epoch for the Byron era.
                           (default: 21600)
  --mainnet                Use the mainnet magic id. This overrides the
                           CARDANO_NODE_NETWORK_ID environment variable
  --testnet-magic NATURAL  Specify a testnet magic id. This overrides the
                           CARDANO_NODE_NETWORK_ID environment variable
  --socket-path SOCKET_PATH
                           Path to the node socket. This overrides the
                           CARDANO_NODE_SOCKET_PATH environment variable. The
                           argument is optional if CARDANO_NODE_SOCKET_PATH is
                           defined and mandatory otherwise.
  --volatile-tip           Use the volatile tip as a target. (This is the
                           default)
  --immutable-tip          Use the immutable tip as a target.
  --stake-pool-id STAKE_POOL_ID
                           Stake pool ID/verification key hash (either
                           Bech32-encoded or hex-encoded).
  --current-params         Keep the current parameters of the pool.
  --pending-params         Keep the parameters of the pending update of the
                           pool.
  --bls-signing-key-file FILEPATH
                           Input filepath of the BLS signing key.
  --out-file FILEPATH      The output file.
  -h,--help                Show this help text
